<title>USA: Atlantic Intl names Halaburda CFO.</title>
<headline>Atlantic Intl names Halaburda CFO.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atlantic International Entertainment Ltd said Friday that it has named David Halaburda chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Halaburda had been the company's Certified Public Accountant since its inception.</p>
<p>A company spokeswoman was not avialable to say who, if anyone, Halaburda replaces.  </p>
<p>Later, a spokeswoman said that Halaburda fills a newly created position.</p>
</text>
